{"id":"b21577b9c610fde4","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-small-ordinal-operations.md","title":"Ordinal Code Operation Lemma","display":"lem-small-ordinal-operations — Ordinal Code Operation Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-small-ordinal-operations","aliases":["89-lem-small-ordinal-operations"],"display":"lem-small-ordinal-operations — Ordinal Code Operation Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-small-ordinal-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-small-ordinal-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-small-ordinal-operations — Ordinal Code Operation Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0716e09b34db523d\" href=\"?note=0716e09b34db523d\" title=\"89-df-small-ordinal-code\">89-df-small-ordinal-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span>；扩展顺序及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d0=d\\infty=\\infty\">\\(d0=d\\infty=\\infty\\)</span> 采用上述约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}small\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\alpha&lt;\\alpha^{+j},\\\\\n&amp;\\alpha^{-j}\\ne0\\Longrightarrow d(\\alpha^{-j})\\ge j,\\\\\n&amp;\\alpha&gt;\\beta\\land d\\alpha\\ge j\\land d\\beta\\ge j\n\\Longrightarrow\\alpha\\ge\\beta^{+j},\\\\\n&amp;(\\alpha^{+j})^{-(j+1)}\\le\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}small\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\alpha&lt;\\alpha^{+j},\\\\\n&amp;\\alpha^{-j}\\ne0\\Longrightarrow d(\\alpha^{-j})\\ge j,\\\\\n&amp;\\alpha&gt;\\beta\\land d\\alpha\\ge j\\land d\\beta\\ge j\n\\Longrightarrow\\alpha\\ge\\beta^{+j},\\\\\n&amp;(\\alpha^{+j})^{-(j+1)}\\le\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.212–213，Lemma 2。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>按有限码字典序证明。若截断不删任何项，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{+j}\">\\(\\alpha^{+j}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 接一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>；否则新码在首个被删的指数处以更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 取代之，所以第一式成立。非空截断的末项至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>第三式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的真前缀，新增的首项至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\ge\\beta\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\">\\(\\alpha\\ge\\beta\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\)</span>；否则在首个差异处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 更大，追加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 不改变比较。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=0\">\\(\\beta=0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta^{+j}=\\langle j\\rangle\">\\(\\beta^{+j}=\\langle j\\rangle\\)</span>，非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的全部指数至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，结论同样成立。第四式只保留原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 中指数大于等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j+1\">\\(j+1\\)</span> 的前缀。</p>\n<p>以上逐条对应原书 Lemma 2，包含空码边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-small-ordinal-code","status":"resolved","id":"0716e09b34db523d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d0=d\\infty=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}small\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}operations}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\alpha<\\alpha^{+j},\\\\\n&\\alpha^{-j}\\ne0\\Longrightarrow d(\\alpha^{-j})\\ge j,\\\\\n&\\alpha>\\beta\\land d\\alpha\\ge j\\land d\\beta\\ge j\n\\Longrightarrow\\alpha\\ge\\beta^{+j},\\\\\n&(\\alpha^{+j})^{-(j+1)}\\le\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha^{+j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\ge\\beta\\frown\\langle j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta^{+j}=\\langle j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j+1","display":false}],"bytes":1677,"backlinks":[{"id":"0413066aa327a245","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"34a172f6f4cae8dd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"序数与公式：[[89-df-small-ordinal-code]] → [[89-lem-small-ordinal-operations]] → [[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]] → [[89-lem-glb-box-absorption]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-comparison]] → [[89-lem-glb-ordinal-truncation]]。"}],"outgoing":["0716e09b34db523d"]}